    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "slm_left_note_t",
      "x": 78, "y": 510,
      "width": 604, "height": 56,
      "text": "关键点：单个 d̂_t（MC 估计）可能为负，尽管 KL 在期望意义下非负\npolicy loss 使用修改后的 Â_t，使 OPD 项与任意 advantage 估计器叠加",
      "originalText": "关键点：单个 d̂_t（MC 估计）可能为负，尽管 KL 在期望意义下非负\npolicy loss 使用修改后的 Â_t，使 OPD 项与任意 advantage 估计器叠加",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
