    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "slm_f1_t",
      "x": 798, "y": 240,
      "width": 624, "height": 56,
      "text": "每个 token 的 reverse KL：D_KL(π_θ(·|h_t) ‖ π_T(·|h_t))\n= E_{a_t∼π_θ}[ log π_θ(a_t|h_t) − log π_T(a_t|h_t) ]",
      "originalText": "每个 token 的 reverse KL：D_KL(π_θ(·|h_t) ‖ π_T(·|h_t))\n= E_{a_t∼π_θ}[ log π_θ(a_t|h_t) − log π_T(a_t|h_t) ]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
