    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "slm_note2_t",
      "x": 798, "y": 640,
      "width": 624, "height": 56,
      "text": "λ_opd 即 --opd-kl-coef；A_t 来自所配置估计器（纯蒸馏时 A_t = 0）\nOPD 项与 GRPO / PPO / REINFORCE++ / GSPO 等 advantage 估计器可叠加",
      "originalText": "λ_opd 即 --opd-kl-coef；A_t 来自所配置估计器（纯蒸馏时 A_t = 0）\nOPD 项与 GRPO / PPO / REINFORCE++ / GSPO 等 advantage 估计器可叠加",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
